<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49705" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umbrĭfĕr</span></b> ,
			ĕra, ĕrum, adj.
		umbra-fero. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Shade-bringing</i>, <i>shade-giving</i>, <i>casting a shade</i>, <i>shady</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">platanus, Cic. poët. Div. 2. 30, 63:
					nemus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 473</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rupes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 2, 11</span></i>
			: Academia, Cic. poët. Div. 1, 13,
			22.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> (Acc.
			to umbra, I. B. 2.) <i>Bearing</i> or <i>carrying the shades of the dead</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Albin.
					1, 427</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 8, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fundus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 57</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
